From: Trần Phát Đạt (Steve Dat) <ttd1232004@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] data/pkg_depends: Register ibus-vielotus and fcitx5-vielotus for Vietnamese (vi)

Registers the split packages `ibus-vielotus` (when `ibus` is active) and
`fcitx5-vielotus` (when `fcitx5` is active) in Ubuntu's
`language-selector-common` dependency table (`data/pkg_depends`) so selecting
Vietnamese (`vi`) in Ubuntu Language Support installs only the matching
framework plugin and shared `libvielotus0` core without pulling in unused
input method frameworks.
---
 data/pkg_depends | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/data/pkg_depends b/data/pkg_depends
index 8a91e42..b24c81e 100644
--- a/data/pkg_depends
+++ b/data/pkg_depends
@@ -143,6 +143,8 @@ im:th::gtk-im-libthai
 im:th::gtk3-im-libthai
 
 im:vi::ibus-unikey
+im:vi:fcitx5:fcitx5-vielotus
+im:vi:ibus:ibus-vielotus
 
 im:zh-hans::fcitx5-frontend-gtk2
 im:zh-hans::fcitx5-frontend-gtk3
-- 
2.43.0
